# What each reranker alias resolves to: alias | repository | ONNX file | ONNX data file | tokenizer repository | tokenizer file | input length | licence | languages | architecture | output.
# CatalogSnapshotTests compares this file with the registry's built-in models (user aliases are not part of it).
# Edit it in the same commit as any catalog change and add a CHANGELOG line for each changed alias (docs/CATALOG.md).
reranker:auto | tiers | Low=default,Medium=quality,High=multilingual,Ultra=multilingual
reranker:default | cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2 | onnx/model.onnx |  |  | tokenizer.json | 512 | Apache-2.0 | english | Bert | SingleLogit
reranker:fast | cross-encoder/ms-marco-TinyBERT-L-2-v2 | onnx/model.onnx |  |  | tokenizer.json | 512 | Apache-2.0 | english | Bert | SingleLogit
reranker:large | BAAI/bge-reranker-large | onnx/model.onnx | onnx/model.onnx_data |  | tokenizer.json | 512 | MIT | multilingual | XlmRoberta | SingleLogit
reranker:ms-marco-l12 | cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-12-v2 | onnx/model.onnx |  |  | tokenizer.json | 512 | Apache-2.0 | english | Bert | SingleLogit
reranker:multilingual | onnx-community/bge-reranker-v2-m3-ONNX | onnx/model.onnx | onnx/model.onnx_data | BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3 | tokenizer.json | 8192 | Apache-2.0 | multilingual | XlmRoberta | SingleLogit
reranker:quality | BAAI/bge-reranker-base | onnx/model.onnx |  |  | tokenizer.json | 512 | MIT | multilingual | XlmRoberta | SingleLogit
